  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A travelling wave of time period 2.0 s is moving through a medium. The graph shows, for one instant, the variation with distance of the displacement of particles in the medium.</p>\n<p>What is the speed of the wave?<br/><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">0.75 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">1.5 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">3.0 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">6.0 m s<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
